-so that proxy and repository authentication continue to work.
+scripts are additionally run with a small environment. Their PATH is
+apt's configured DPkg::Path rather than the caller's executable search path.
+The environment also contains the target temporary directory, mmdebstrap's
+fixed noninteractive debconf and C.UTF-8 locale values, reproducibility
+controls, foreign-architecture state, and fakeroot state when active. Apt
+itself retains its environment so that proxy and repository authentication
+continue to work.
 
